*               keeps what each set.viewer answered, the Esc rule, the key hint out of the first status message.
* 28 Oct 26 dm  S.88 L2: the four boxes are panes of the layout service ($tk_layout): at 140 by 43 exactly the boxes the page has always drawn, in a bigger window the two lists show
